(FennSill Quick Start) Tj
T*
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
50 698 Td
14 TL
() Tj
T*
(Your e-ink panel arrives already flashed. You only need to install FennSill,) Tj
T*
(link your account, and connect the AI tools you already use.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Install FennSill) Tj
T*
(   - Download FennsillSetup.exe from the FennSill releases page.) Tj
T*
(   - Run it and allow the Administrator \(UAC\) prompt.) Tj
T*
(   - Wait until FennSill Desk opens. Setup also installs the FennSill Agent) Tj
T*
(     service so the panel stays checked in when Desk is closed.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2. Plug in the panel) Tj
T*
(   - Connect the panel with USB.) Tj
T*
(   - Desk should show: FennSill panel connected.) Tj
T*
(   - Copy Device ID, Serial, and Install key from Desk when needed.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3. Link your account) Tj
T*
(   - Open the FennSill account site and sign up or sign in.) Tj
T*
(   - Use Link your panel and paste the Device ID from Desk.) Tj
T*
(   - Do not put Device ID in the AI MCP connector form.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(4. Paste the device key) Tj
T*
(   - On the account site: Mint device key, then Copy.) Tj
T*
(   - In Desk, click Paste device key.) Tj
T*
(   - Status should become Cloud: checked in.) Tj
T*
(   - You can close Desk; the Agent service keeps check-in while USB is plugged in.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(5. Connect any AI that supports custom MCP) Tj
T*
(   Works the same for ChatGPT, Claude, Cursor, and similar tools:) Tj
T*
(   - MCP URL = the MCP URL from your FennSill account site) Tj
T*
(   - Add header Authorization = Bearer <token> \(use Copy header on the site\)) Tj
T*
(   - Leave any Bearer token environment-variable field empty) Tj
T*
(   - Device ID does not go in the MCP form) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(6. Try a push) Tj
T*
(   - Ask your AI to send a simple page to your panel \(for example a short greeting\).) Tj
T*
(   - Confirm the e-ink screen refreshes.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(7. Troubleshooting) Tj
T*
(   - Panel not seen: try another USB cable/port; click Refresh in Desk.) Tj
T*
(   - Cloud offline / agent stale: open Services and confirm FennSill Agent is Running;) Tj
T*
(     Paste device key again if needed.) Tj
T*
(   - AI cannot push: re-check MCP URL and Authorization Bearer header on the same account.) Tj
T*
(   - ChatGPT says tools unavailable / connector missing in this chat \(Desk still checked in\):) Tj
T*
(     Open the FennSill connector ? Manage ? Refresh \(or re-save the Authorization header\),) Tj
T*
(     then start a NEW chat and select FennSill. Do not remint the device key.) Tj
T*
ET
ET
